2. **Complementary Support to Traditional Methods:** C.A.T. can be used alongside traditional medicine to enhance its effectiveness. For example, massage therapy can help reduce stress and anxiety in patients with heart disease, while acupuncture can help manage nausea and vomiting in HIV patients.
