     \]  
     Given:  
     - Mass of (A) = 0.0088 g  
     - Mass of camphor = 0.5 g  
     - \(\Delta T_f = 8°C\)  
     - \(K_f\) (freezing point depression constant for camphor) = 28.6°C·kg/mol  
