Once we have the energy released by the HMTT explosion, we can calculate the energy required to release the same pressure wave using the given percentage (70%) and the energy per gram of TNT (4680 J/g).

Finally, we can calculate the mass of TNT required by dividing the total energy required by the energy per gram of TNT.
