\[
n \sin \left( 90^\circ - \beta \right) = n_0 \sin \left( 90^\circ \right) \implies \cos \beta = \frac{1}{1.5} \implies \beta = \boxed{46.87^\circ}
\]  

(b) The transmission coefficient for a normal-incident beam is given by:  
\[
T = \frac{(1 - \rho_1)(1 - \rho_2)(1 - \rho_3)(1 - \rho_4)}{1 - \rho_1 \rho_2 \rho_3 \rho_4}
\]  
